{"sha": "5c570771e62523d5d56da434648f6368fded74282dff3dd2692867cba6a51dbe", "body": ["\\textbf{13.} $(\\lambda^n)$ 为解当且仅当 $\\lambda^{n+2} =", "s\\lambda^{n+1} - p\\lambda^n$ 对所有 $n$ 成立，即 $D(\\lambda) = 0$", "（两边除以 $\\lambda^n \\neq 0$；注意 $\\lambda, \\mu \\neq", "0$，因为 $p = \\lambda\\mu \\neq 0$）。证明", "$\\bigl((\\lambda^n), (\\mu^n)\\bigr)$ 线性无关：在 $n = 0, 1$ 处的关系式", "给出 $c + c' = 0$，$c\\lambda + c'\\mu = 0$，于是 $c(\\lambda - \\mu)", "= 0$，得 $c = c' = 0$。在 $2$ 维空间中，两个线性无关的向量即为基。", "重根情形：$\\bigl((n\\lambda^n)\\bigr)$ 为解，", "因 $s = 2\\lambda$，$p = \\lambda^2$：", "\\[", "s(n+1)\\lambda^{n+1} - p\\,n\\lambda^n", "= \\lambda^{n+2}\\bigl(2(n+1) - n\\bigr) = (n+2)\\lambda^{n+2} ;", "\\]", "线性无关性：在 $n = 0, 1$ 处得 $c = 0$，再由 $c'\\lambda = 0$", "且 $\\lambda \\neq 0$，于是两系数皆为零。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $D = X^2 - X - 6 = (X - 3)(X + 2)$。通解", "为 $u_n = A\\,3^n + B(-2)^n$；由初始条件得", "$A + B = 1$，$3A - 2B = 8$，故 $A = 2$，$B = -1$：", "\\[", "u_n = 2\\cdot 3^n - (-2)^n .", "\\]", "验算：$u_2 = 18 - 4 = 14 = u_1 + 6u_0$；$u_3 = 54 + 8 = 62 =", "u_2 + 6u_1 = 14 + 48$。", "", "\\textbf{15.} $C\\begin{pmatrix} u_n\\\\ u_{n+1}\\end{pmatrix} =", "\\begin{pmatrix} u_{n+1}\\\\ -p\\,u_n + s\\,u_{n+1}\\end{pmatrix} =", "\\begin{pmatrix} u_{n+1}\\\\ u_{n+2}\\end{pmatrix}$，由归纳法", "给出含 $C^n$ 的公式。又 $\\operatorname{tr} C = 0", "+ s = s$，且 $p(C) = 0\\cdot s - 1\\cdot(-p) = p$：友矩阵", "恰以 $D$ 为其凯莱--哈密顿多项式。", "", "\\textbf{16.} 设 $u$ 为满足 $u_{n+3} = \\alpha u_{n+2} +", "\\beta u_{n+1} + \\gamma u_n$ 的任一解，则状态向量 $v_n = (u_n,", "u_{n+1}, u_{n+2})^{\\mathsf T}$ 满足 $C_3 v_n = v_{n+1}$", "（前两行整体平移，末行由", "递推关系给出）。于是", "\\[", "D_3(C_3)\\,v_0 = v_3 - \\alpha v_2 - \\beta v_1 - \\gamma v_0 ,", "\\]", "其三个分量为 $u_{k+3} - \\alpha u_{k+2} - \\beta", "u_{k+1} - \\gamma u_k = 0$（$k = 0, 1, 2$）。", "由于初始状态 $v_0 = (u_0, u_1, u_2)^{\\mathsf T}$ 取遍 \\emph{全部}", "$K^3$ 中的向量（初值可任意取定），矩阵 $D_3(C_3)$ 零化", "每个向量，于是 $D_3(C_3) = 0$。", "", "\\textbf{17.} 写 $X^n = Q\\,D_3 + R_n$，其中 $\\deg R_n \\leq 2$", "并在各根处求值：$\\lambda_i^n = R_n(\\lambda_i)$。于是", "$R_n$ 是次数 $\\leq 2$ 的多项式，它插值三个", "值 $\\lambda_i^n$（位于三个互异节点 $\\lambda_i$ 处）。由", "\\cref{thm:b1:poly:lagrange}中的唯一性，$R_n = \\sum_i", "\\lambda_i^n L_i$，其中 $(L_i)$ 为节点的拉格朗日基。", "代入 $C_3$（第 5 题与第 16 题）：", "\\[", "C_3^{\\,n} = R_n(C_3) = \\sum_{i=1}^{3} \\lambda_i^n\\,L_i(C_3),", "\\]", "其中三个矩阵 $L_i(C_3)$ 与 $n$ 无关，故", "$C_3^{\\,n}$ 的每一个元素，都是 $\\lambda_1^n,", "\\lambda_2^n, \\lambda_3^n$ 的固定线性组合。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $D_3 = X^3 - 2X^2 - X + 2 = (X-1)(X+1)(X-2)$。", "通解为 $u_n = A + B(-1)^n + C\\,2^n$。初始", "条件：$A + B + C = 0$，$A - B + 2C = 1$，$A + B + 4C = 1$。", "将第三式减去第一式：$3C = 1$，$C = \\frac13$；", "于是 $A + B = -\\frac13$，$A - B = \\frac13$，得 $A = 0$，$B =", "-\\frac13$。由此", "\\[", "u_n = \\frac{2^n - (-1)^n}{3}", "\\]", "（雅各布斯塔尔数）。验算：$u_3 = \\frac{8 + 1}{3} = 3 =", "2u_2 + u_1 - 2u_0 = 2 + 1 - 0$。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 多项式 $X^n$ 在", "$\\lambda$ 处的泰勒展开：", "\\[", "X^n = \\sum_{k=0}^{n} \\binom nk \\lambda^{n-k}(X - \\lambda)^k ,", "\\]", "而 $k \\geq 3$ 的各项均可被 $(X -", "\\lambda)^3$ 整除，余式为", "\\[", "R_n = \\lambda^n + n\\lambda^{n-1}(X - \\lambda) + \\binom", "n2\\lambda^{n-2}(X - \\lambda)^2 .", "\\]", "设 $M = \\lambda I + N$，且 $N^3 = 0$，则 $(M - \\lambda I)^3 = N^3", "= 0$，由第 5 题可得", "\\[", "M^n = \\lambda^n I + n\\lambda^{n-1} N + \\binom n2", "\\lambda^{n-2} N^2 ,", "\\]", "这恰是 $(\\lambda I + N)^n$ 的二项展开", "在 $N^2$ 处截断 --- 两种方法结果一致。", "", "\\textbf{20.} 解空间的维数为 $3$（参数化方式与", "第 11 题相同，由 $(u_0, u_1, u_2)$ 参数化），且", "每个 $(\\lambda_i^n)$ 都是解。线性无关性：设", "$c_1\\lambda_1^n + c_2\\lambda_2^n + c_3\\lambda_3^n = 0$，对 $n =", "0, 1, 2$ 成立。固定 $i$，记 $L_i = \\sum_{k \\leq 2} p_k X^k$ 为", "关于节点的拉格朗日多项式，满足 $L_i(\\lambda_j) =", "\\delta_{ij}$。于是", "\\[", "0 = \\sum_{k=0}^{2} p_k\\Bigl(\\sum_j c_j\\lambda_j^k\\Bigr)", "= \\sum_j c_j\\,L_i(\\lambda_j) = c_i .", "\\]", "故所有 $c_i = 0$，三个线性无关的解在 $3$ 维空间中", "构成一组基；通解为 $c_1\\lambda_1^n +", "c_2\\lambda_2^n + c_3\\lambda_3^n$。", "", "\\textbf{21.} 由 $F_k = F_{k+2} - F_{k+1}$，求和可裂项相消：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=1}^{n} F_k = \\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\bigl(F_{k+2} - F_{k+1}\\bigr)", "= F_{n+2} - F_2 = F_{n+2} - 1 .", "\\]", ""]}